<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises 1.53 bln markka.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises 1.53 bln markka.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction April 15 versus April 8  SUVK :</p>
<p>			THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days   181/188		363/337</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct   3.13/3.17	    3.42/3.42</p>
<p> Highest yld     3.13/3.17	    3.42/3.42</p>
<p> Lowest  yld     3.11/3.17	    3.39/3.41</p>
<p> Amount,FIM million 1,000/871	    528.5/900</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million  2,100/2,543	  808.5/2,360</p>
<p>After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 44,154 million markka, the STO said. @</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
